<title>POLAND: WEDEL JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.45 vs   1.61 (loss)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.37 vs   2.41 (loss)</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.17 vs   2.83 (loss)</p>
<p> Sales		   61.97 vs  38.93</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.22 vs   8.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	25.46 vs   9.80</p>
<p> Operating profit    23.25 vs   6.29</p>
<p> Sales		  357.80 vs 288.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionery is Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Cukierniczego Wedel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
